      <title>Save the Date: National Community Development Week Showcase</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">59780634</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/3902e1a</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none; background-color: #000000;" bgcolor="#000000">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/06/3429727/message-from-the-mayor_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="banner" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Save the Date for the National Community Development Week Showcase</h1>
<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><em>Tuesday, April 2, 2024</em></h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><br>Dear Community Leaders,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Each year, National Community Development Week highlights how funding from the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD) helps build strong, resilient and vibrant communities across America. Please join the City of Columbus on <strong>Tuesday, April 2</strong> for a special event for elected officials and community leaders showcasing the impact of the Columbus Housing Strategy, the HOME Investment Partnerships Program (HOME), and the Community Development Block Grant (CDBG). </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">This showcase will consist of three phases: networking with light refreshments (8:30 a.m. – 9:00 a.m.), presentations from community leaders (9:00 a.m. – 10:00 a.m.), and a shuttle bus tour (10:15 a.m. – 12:00 p.m.). The shuttle bus will travel through the South Side and visit the South End Cafe, Livingston Park, and more. Riders will learn about the financing tools that brought these housing developments to life.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Please join us to celebrate our successes in creating new affordable housing and elevating our collective future. Please <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfe0Bkxmx7nJDtS8CdCCzp5RfElvDlxJalHpJMVlPt0-PkSpg/viewform?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Link" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">RSVP</a> by Friday, March 22<strong>. Space is limited.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfe0Bkxmx7nJDtS8CdCCzp5RfElvDlxJalHpJMVlPt0-PkSpg/viewform?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Link" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/03/7302770/registerbuttonasset-1_original.png" style="width: 162px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Black registration button" width="162" height="45"></a></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>What is the Columbus Housing Strategy? </strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Central Ohio’s housing supply is not keeping pace with our record growth. If current building patterns continue, regional housing demand is projected to eclipse supply by 2030, and everyone in our region will experience the consequences.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Columbus Housing Strategy means we must build more housing of all kinds – market-rate, workforce and affordable. As we do, we must employ new tools to <strong>build</strong> twice as much housing and <strong>invest</strong> in additional affordable housing for families and individuals. We must also <strong>preserve</strong> existing affordability and protect residents from eviction and displacement. With all of this work, we will <strong>include</strong> low-income residents and people of color by cultivating economically diverse neighborhoods. </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/06/3429563/3097149/mag-signature-new_crop.png" style="width: 210px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="signature" width="210" height="112"><p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Andrew J. Ginther,<br>Mayor</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
